OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught with #2.6m of cocaine
OL,4,Aamong Santa gift bags jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was caught with #2.6m of
OL,7,Fcocaine stashed among Santa gift bags
OL,8,Fin a Glasgow flat has been jailed for
OL,9,Fmore than four years.
OL,11,FJordan Wetherill was arrested after 100
OL,12,Fblocks of cocaine and a small amount of
OL,13,Fheroin were recovered from a property
OL,14,Fin Balintore Street, Shettleston, on 21
OL,15,FDecember last year.
OL,17,FThe court was previously shown a video
OL,18,Fof the police operation with the huge
OL,19,Fhaul of drugs taped up in the living
OL,20,Froom among festive gift bags.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
